267:  /// candidate fragment as a precomputed dot product instead of an O(P log F) per-pair search.
268:  /// This is the hot-path optimization: precursor XIC is prepared once per precursor (not per
269:  /// fragment), fragment means/norms are precomputed once per window. [perf]
270:  /// CSR layout: one `vector<vector<...>>` costs 24 B of header PER FRAGMENT before a single
