   680	`SPEXTRACT_BACKFILL_RAW=50` applied only to precursors below the window's q-quantile of MS1 intensity. Emission is
   681	unchanged (927,813 spectra in every arm), so this is purely a content lever.
   682	| dataset D arm | Sage @1% (apex 12,537) | MSFragger @1% (apex 11,927; dt 13,932) | dt-only | shared w/ dt |
   683	|---|---|---|---|---|
   684	| **q=0.5** | 12,442 (−0.8%; only-apex 460 / only-q 365) | **12,492 (+4.7%, 89.7% of dt)** | 2,940 | **12,034** |
