    10	
    11	src/DIAPseudoSpectra.cpp originated as a TOPP tool inside the OpenMS source tree and
    12	was extracted into this standalone repository. It uses OpenMS classes including
    13	MassTraceDetection, ElutionPeakDetection, PeakPickerIM, BrukerTimsFile and
    14	FullSwathFileConsumer, and retains OpenMS's BSD-3-Clause terms.
    15	
    16	Algorithmic ideas were reviewed against, but no code was taken from:
    17	
    18	  the reference implementation (Nesvizhskii Lab)     -- pseudo-MS/MS extraction from diaPASEF
    19	  AlphaDIA (Mann Lab, Apache-2.0) -- feature-free extraction; the log-sum co-elution
    20	                                     statistic here is an independent reimplementation
    21	                                     of a published idea, not a port
    22	  DIA-NN                          -- used only to produce reference annotations
